;Age verification (allow), assumes already logged in as a non priveleged user

Alias "or enter partial description" 453 456
Alias dialogx 506 366
Alias ScanField 90 674

Assert color 90 15 #000080 ;ensures someone is logged in

;search for sauvignon
clickbutton Query
Sleep 200
clickbutton "Select an option" "Item lookup"
Sleep 200

MouseClick "or enter partial description"
Typetext "sauvignon"
PressKey Enter
Sleep 5000

ClickButton "Select Item" OK
Sleep 200

ClickButton "Line details" "Add to sale"
Sleep 5000

;shows a dialog box asking for age auth
Assert memo dialogx "Check customer is over 18 years old. Ask for proof of identity if in doubt. Birthday must be on or before {TODAY-18Y} (authorisation required)"
ClickButton formDlg OK
Sleep 5000

;now need to click cancel out of the Item Query dialog
ClickButton "Item Query" Cancel
Sleep 1000

//enter auth details
;Alias ScanField 90 674
MouseClick ScanField
TypeText "`r`s"
PressKey Enter
Sleep 500

//just choose date not needed (allow)
ClickButton "Age Restricted Items in Sale" "Date not needed"
Sleep 1000

Load "Complete sale"
